          "page": 3,
          "section": "2. Material processing and characterization methods",
          "quote": "For PM material, the powders were first ball milled in a high-energy ball mill using steel vials and alumina balls (diameter 2 mm and 3 mm) as milling media. The powders and balls (1:2) mixture were sealed in the steel vials and filled with argon gas. Mechanical milling was carried out in a planetary ball mill for an effective milling time of 10 h. The rotational speed during milling was fixed at 300 r/min.",
